# Written on the host by the deploy (docs/operations/monitoring/sherlog.md): Sherlog's bundle from its image, settings, rendered rules.
*
!sherlog.yaml
!.gitignore
# The bind-mount sources (docker-compose.egov-digit.yaml, docker-compose.monitoring.yml) exist in a checkout, so Docker
# does not create them as root. The deploy's config sync leaves the placeholders out (--exclude=.gitkeep).
!rendered/
rendered/*
!rendered/loki/
rendered/loki/*
!rendered/loki/.gitkeep
!textfile/
textfile/*
!textfile/.gitkeep
